msgid "Sim4Life.lite: Features and Limitations"
msgstr "Características y limitaciones de Sim4Life.lite"

# CTX-INTERPRETATION: This string appears within the S4LLiteSpecs.js file,
# likely as part of a user interface element describing the Sim4Life.lite
# platform and its features for students.
#: services/static-webserver/client/source/class/osparc/product/quickStart/s4llite/S4LLiteSpecs.js:28
msgid ""
"        Sim4Life.lite is a powerful web-based simulation platform that "
"allows you to model and analyze real-world phenomena and to         design "
"complex technical devices in a validated environment. Sim4Life.lite has been"
" created specifically for students to         facilitate their understanding"
" of computational modeling and simulations for various topics, ranging from "
"wireless communication         to medical applications. The access to "
"Sim4Life.lite is available free of charge to students enrolled at registered"
" universities.      "
msgstr ""
"Sim4Life.lite es una potente plataforma de simulación basada en la web que "
"le permite modelar y analizar fenómenos del mundo real y diseñar "
"dispositivos técnicos complejos en un entorno validado. Sim4Life.lite ha "
"sido creada específicamente para estudiantes para facilitar su comprensión "
"del modelado computacional y las simulaciones para diversos temas, que van "
"desde las comunicaciones inalámbricas hasta las aplicaciones médicas. El "
"acceso a Sim4Life.lite está disponible de forma gratuita para los "
"estudiantes matriculados en universidades registradas.      "

# CTX-INTERPRETATION: This string appears in a section describing the features
# of the Sim4Life.lite software, specifically highlighting the available
# solvers and tissue models.
msgid ""
"        <b>Sim4Life.lite offers</b><br>        - Framework (GUI, Modeling, "
"Postprocessing)<br>        - 3D modeling environment (based on the ACIS "
"toolkit) and CAD translators<br>        - Postprocessing and visualization "
"of the simulation results (2D and 3D viewers, 2D planar slice, volume "
"rendering, streamlines, surface fields on arbitrary 3D structures, radiation"
" and far-field data)<br>        - No restrictions on number of modeling "
"objects<br>        - Solvers & Tissue Models:<br>        &emsp;- P-EM-FDTD: "
"Electromagnetics Full-Wave Solver<br>        &emsp;- P-EM-QS: Quasi-Static "
"Electromagnetics Solver<br>        &emsp;- P-Thermal: Thermodynamic "
"Solver<br>        &emsp;- P-Acoustics: Acoustics Solver<br>        &emsp;- "
"T-Neuro: Neuronal Tissue Models<br>        - Computational anatomical model "
"Yoon-sun, the first Korean model of the IT’IS Virtual Population<br>        "
"- Material database<br>        - Python and Jupyter Notebook scripting      "
msgstr ""
"Sim4Life.lite ofrece\n"
"- Marco (GUI, Modelado, Postprocesamiento)\n"
"- Entorno de modelado 3D (basado en el kit ACIS) y traductores CAD\n"
"- Postprocesamiento y visualización de los resultados de la simulación (visualizadores 2D y 3D, corte plano 2D, renderizado de volumen, líneas de flujo, campos de superficie en estructuras 3D arbitrarias, datos de radiación y campo lejano)\n"
"- Sin restricciones en el número de objetos de modelado\n"
"- Simuladores y Modelos de Tejido:\n"
"&emsp;- P-EM-FDTD: Simulador de Electromagnetismo de Onda Completa\n"
"&emsp;- P-EM-QS: Simulador de Electromagnetismo Quasi-Estático\n"
"&emsp;- P-Thermal: Simulador Termodinámico\n"
"&emsp;- P-Acoustics: Simulador Acústico      "

# CTX-INTERPRETATION: This string appears in a user interface section
# describing the limitations of a scientific simulation application,
# specifically outlining hardware and software constraints.
msgid ""
"        <b>Limitations</b><br>        The following limitations apply:<br>"
"        - Grid size of each simulation is limited to a maximum of <b>20 "
"million grid cells</b><br>        - High-Performance Computing is not "
"supported:<br>        &emsp;- GPU acceleration is not available<br>        "
"&emsp;- MPI multicore acceleration is not available<br>        - 3rd-party "
"tools are not available (e.g., MUSAIK, SYSSIM, IMAnalytics, etc…)<br>"
"        - Additional ViP models cannot be added<br>        - 30 minutes idle"
" time before logout<br>        - Hardware resource limits<br>        &emsp;-"
" 3 CPUs<br>        &emsp;- 3 GB of GPU RAM<br>        &emsp;- 5 GB disk "
"space<br>        &emsp;- 16 GB RAM<br>      "
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes limitaciones se aplican:<br> - El tamaño de la cuadrícula de "
"cada simulación está limitado a un máximo de 20 millones de celdas<br> - No "
"se admite el Alto Rendimiento:<br> &nbsp;- La aceleración de GPU no está "
"disponible<br> &nbsp;- La aceleración de MPI multicore no está "
"disponible<br> - No están disponibles las herramientas de terceros (por "
"ejemplo, MUSAIK, SYSSIM, IMAnalytics, etc…)<br> - No se pueden añadir "
"modelos ViP adicionales<br> - 30 minutos de inactividad antes de cerrar "
"sesión<br> - Límites de recursos de hardware<br> &emsp;- 3 CPUs<br> &emsp;- "
"3 GB de RAM de GPU<br> &emsp;- 5 GB de espacio en disco<br> &emsp;- 16 GB de"
" RAM      "

